(7111168, 1085159, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is delightful. Understated, and very believable. A tiny nit, however, is that the top of the palm is so clear when the rest of the glass in that area has a harsh reflection. I know it was to show the palm, but a  slight residual opacity of that reflection would have rendered this technically perfect :-)</td>', 'This is delightful. Understated, and very believable. A tiny nit, however, is that the top of the palm is so clear when the rest of the glass in that area has a harsh reflection. I know it was to show the palm, but a  slight residual opacity of that reflection would have rendered this technically perfect :-)', '2013-10-04 16:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
